"que j’ai commis une grave erreur."

#: scenario:scenario_4658E743_4327_4AE0_A0D6_F4ED2C05ED7A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 118bc7016a1c02ba7116148c7fe031065f538a5548f1b8bf63bf8757b433e8c6
#. default-sha256: d7b18d566369af4fe648a7bf508bd93ef48c734788c1889e6fc79ecfe1fc1c12
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_4658E743_4327_4AE0_A0D6_F4ED2C05ED7A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫My transgression is that I was unable to completely predict where this path we were "
"traveling led."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ma transgression est due au fait que j’ai été incapable de prédire exactement où le chemin "
"que nous avions pris nous mènerait."

#: scenario:scenario_F421FEF6_8212_4F76_902F_126E652CBBA2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 992d9deb922efc2a307cc9aaf369d0197beb82ab436fef7aa26da0d0189bb063
#. default-sha256: 5390587ce25284a7ba718a2587da2e63910d54bdf8df12414714dbb003c8f71f
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_F421FEF6_8212_4F76_902F_126E652CBBA2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫My hands were full dealing with my immediate day-to-day tasks, ⟪k:1⟫so I could do naught but "
"pray there was happiness waiting in the future."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫J’étais trop occupée à mes tâches quotidiennes, ⟪k:1⟫donc je ne pouvais rien faire d’autre "
"que prier pour que l’avenir soit plus radieux."

#: scenario:scenario_04CA1AB7_ED67_44C2_99D6_240B21119DA2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 44df6e9592a3fe77b4f1a38fbc1938abc7314641c5ee37e2b6171d30ab63a294
#. default-sha256: bd38935429346588655b931b9b515f5fcb0c8bfb37d56cd6908fb9b9a2faf171
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_04CA1AB7_ED67_44C2_99D6_240B21119DA2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Happiness for everyone who lived within Rose Manor."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Que tous les habitants du manoir des Roses soient heureux."

#: scenario:scenario_74D191F3_BB97_4584_A235_BF0E0F8B6ADA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2996cf1860d775aab1e53ae0e5b193461aad925fe50e643dfbdefe1c2ca040bd
#. default-sha256: f51a11bd0d6f915436fe65c0b2392f5e336ec2234c157ae681ed745e1890a823
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_74D191F3_BB97_4584_A235_BF0E0F8B6ADA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But I am but a mere maid. ⟪k:1⟫There are limits to what I am allowed to do. ⟪k:2⟫And "
"furthermore, it was not my place to offer her my hand."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mais je ne suis qu’une simple servante. ⟪k:1⟫Il y a des limites à ce que l’on m’autorise à "
"faire. ⟪k:2⟫De plus, ce n’était pas à moi de lui prêter main forte."

#: scenario:scenario_AAA2349C_6637_4436_A69F_0E7A3C2D9015
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ce58848080f0f65650522c1fdf4e9c663415019d4ae6dc7163f5fe2269c51b79
#. default-sha256: aaeb06836f64eacae7762f05a5c63810389a920b00399f7f9a229d6d2f8888fe
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_AAA2349C_6637_4436_A69F_0E7A3C2D9015"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Roads, such as the one we were following, have a way of diverging with little warning."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Les routes, comme celle que nous suivons, ont tendance à bifurquer sans crier gare."

#: scenario:scenario_887020DA_B005_43BF_A41A_0E9FBBA7E143
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c894cadcc1d24b793950555a8467f5eab0fa9135ecdadf3fb599a0b30e507826
#. default-sha256: 5d9e29ed5ecacc902270aa138213f9cc2c365dd325f7bf345e1858ed2e48e6d4
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_887020DA_B005_43BF_A41A_0E9FBBA7E143"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And if you do not turn the wheel exactly right at those sudden forks, you may end up "
"somewhere horribly off course. ⟪k:1⟫I was well aware of that fact..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Et si l’on ne tourne pas le guidon à temps, ces virages soudains nous emmènent horriblement "
"loin de notre trajectoire. ⟪k:1⟫J’en avais bien conscience..."

#: scenario:scenario_287A7800_5BC1_414D_8DC3_0E3F77FFDDE2
