msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I’ll say it as many times as I must: ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I love you.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫And I wouldn’t be able "
"to accept losing you without knowing anything."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Je le dirai autant de fois qu’il le faudra : ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫je vous aime.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Et je "
"n’accepterai pas de vous perdre sans rien savoir."

#: scenario:scenario_1E2E1D6E_06C6_45D2_80D4_D0C1D86C8458
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 861e597cf43b45927b86167598a9ef10ba98cda91c149cd9f061b2d780d46acd
