#: scenario:scenario_370DCC67_C39B_47A0_8F61_70DDD955AB8F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 047a552105953fbab8f9343f2c155225efbdee07de823bb67e6197b1d80ae91f
