msgctxt "scenario:scenario_A021B417_9600_4A0D_8AD0_FD48109DB284"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The White-Haired Girl, having finally gathered the courage, began to slowly tell her tale."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La Fille aux Cheveux Blancs rassembla son courage à deux mains et commença à raconter "
"lentement son histoire."

#: scenario:scenario_7057D7E3_AA09_4B19_96B6_1163119CB401
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ac56943fdb9a141968c5dbf7733a86664895befe65ce7f13a87c9dcbf785c42e
#. default-sha256: 93c03e7ac58275685a52c7f57c21e8851c446907d8bb819516d49a3011208df6
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_7057D7E3_AA09_4B19_96B6_1163119CB401"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫On the night of the storm, I paid a visit to Rose Manor—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫this mansion."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Le soir de l’orage, je suis venue rendre visite au manoir des Roses—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫ce manoir."

#: scenario:scenario_3A9BA9CB_5CD3_4594_BF21_EF595EEBD26B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 35a7c6b639538df54fd181d88cba3b9ffbbbf2191b2e755f8eae91b3332c1d87
#. default-sha256: b8d34d99e4c9e7e85e461b1e13cb1a5200e0e770833580a0601e8f09e5c1013d
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_3A9BA9CB_5CD3_4594_BF21_EF595EEBD26B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫My father and I were always on the move, traveling across the land by foot, so it was only "
"recently that we heard rumors of Rose Manor."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mon père et moi voyagions toujours d’un endroit à l’autre, traversant le pays à pied, donc "
"nous n’avions entendu les rumeurs sur le manoir des Roses que récemment."

#: scenario:scenario_D7A1F02F_2CD7_4697_A434_2F0479BE1C2C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 14f647904d7cba1c1910b882e21a629204b8398f709d825d4fd506b90e837bb5
#. default-sha256: 76664604e89297acf17fef909a450d8bc7464e31c2dca25ef54d63c3e1e9ec14
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_D7A1F02F_2CD7_4697_A434_2F0479BE1C2C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫There are several reasons we couldn’t stay in one place.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫First... ⟪k:3⟫is my "
"unusual appearance."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Plusieurs raisons nous poussaient à ne jamais rester au même endroit.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫D’abord... "
"⟪k:3⟫mon physique très spécial."

#: scenario:scenario_2C9D2B32_97EA_4808_BDDA_26140DDEC0AF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b6b2f8df057479422f6880f103d88015c399f76536e7254c2e6784cbd249705f
#. default-sha256: 51556be39ec1be04949f166dc9afe70e38aeb00a5f6e7cd239635bb1c74f039e
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_2C9D2B32_97EA_4808_BDDA_26140DDEC0AF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫People often find the color of my skin or eyes disconcerting."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Les gens trouvent souvent la couleur de ma peau ou de mes yeux troublante."

#: scenario:scenario_0428C509_3AD5_41EF_A5FB_CC73F0B3390B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 74d88eb2bdc1b05c352e4e8dcb1b00d0a5723ed47ffe6d0f0745dc60340471a7
#. default-sha256: 078f87db3b6c3e1757e924467d976c19841f50e8e3359f11ac4e6fe9b7fcc49e
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_0428C509_3AD5_41EF_A5FB_CC73F0B3390B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫So after living in one place for long enough,⟪k:1⟫unsettling rumors would begin to spread, "
"forcing us to leave."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Donc, quand on vivait au même endroit assez longtemps,⟪k:1⟫des rumeurs inquiétantes "
"commençaient à se répandre et nous forçaient à partir."

#: scenario:scenario_33338E74_9745_4C04_A155_FF439B5330F9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 38451a7e4a77a663c09d2286d4f611d805afea15d6a1fccd0c267d64d24b0894
#. default-sha256: 7a28cd1934524f71e060bc4bec8c8cf4e2ee3a9d84dbe86c8dd4cd7c72809ec6
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_33338E74_9745_4C04_A155_FF439B5330F9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Another reason... ⟪k:1⟫was my father’s line of work.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫He painted pictures for a "
"living."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫L’autre raison... ⟪k:1⟫était le travail de mon père.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Il était peintre d’art."

#: scenario:scenario_1A9D5305_ED42_4671_9F56_10D0C3532AE6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 80291f7f66d362f289a7bd574945468d64035f9d14c64e1f6879cc4f3b9c7d03
#. default-sha256: 9d860379da87e2e3efa62ce552599500f47b583b8570b319d01b691b9cf1f10e
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_1A9D5305_ED42_4671_9F56_10D0C3532AE6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But he had trouble finding a patron, so he had to work day-to-day...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫When he was no "
"longer able to find work in a city, we would move."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mais il avait du mal à trouver un mécène, donc il devait faire au jour le jour...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫"
"Quand il n’arrivait plus à trouver du travail dans une ville, nous déménagions."

#: scenario:scenario_575B60BC_BB37_4475_8BA8_6814A80488A9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0b25401b914a136d74c06099a31d8c78b9c88f7ac7c0cc503d9950cce719208e
#. default-sha256: 775922b3fa00aa30d6442b91a61cf08ca6c96bff0a663c47da1412cd43dd7a46
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_575B60BC_BB37_4475_8BA8_6814A80488A9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫We were birds that migrated without a flock."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Nous étions des oiseaux migrateurs sans horde."

#: scenario:scenario_4A09487B_5B8F_4949_B006_58FCF7D98D50
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c68d2cc31bb513350853f99aeb953dd4208142c57a0bc591f5d301f9ebdaf109
#. default-sha256: e667080808e756001087f39f93f7ad6f9ff2200cd7305466ec5421f2b80fe3b9
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_4A09487B_5B8F_4949_B006_58FCF7D98D50"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫When we arrived at this town, my father was exhausted and weak.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫That is when we "
"learned of Rose Manor..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Quand nous sommes arrivés dans cette ville, mon père était faible et épuisé.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫C’est "
"là que nous avons entendu parler du manoir des Roses..."

#: scenario:scenario_3019C590_EF86_450D_A610_9FC45A26E841
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: de4db4e3d8a0a2f17337de675e3d9515514d4f07ff98da56c45ceb31fee33eab
#. default-sha256: bacc438a0ab7efb7cfa40d92ee13471ecaa432a5b1a8e80e6e10a0a4411711b7
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_3019C590_EF86_450D_A610_9FC45A26E841"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫and the family who dwelled within it.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Rhodes is a name my father could never forget."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫et de la famille qui y vivait.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Rhodes est un nom que mon père n’aurait jamais pu "
"oublier..."

#: scenario:scenario_2801E4E0_E4EC_488C_B0DF_A8D80C68CB0D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6ce46569e6e52dd7aacae3a9c85eae02d7cf60705f61ee627c398b228b153b61
#. default-sha256: 0a53944ddac3802602d1f945d9b9043c2e71dd4e14a24cdebf1590b22f7c904e
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_2801E4E0_E4EC_488C_B0DF_A8D80C68CB0D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫He was, long ago, a painter in service of the Rhodes family."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Il travaillait, dans le temps, comme peintre au service des Rhodes."

#: scenario:scenario_5D6D71B4_BFAE_4E86_91AC_8292A38DAFF1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bea830face54a5a2a8d704ba975f31f26d25736e6e039cd06286e0a8a7481934
#. default-sha256: a8361fb957c9a77986ba56051438dd45e51c8481b8700adf1c9a0fba6f244e3f
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_5D6D71B4_BFAE_4E86_91AC_8292A38DAFF1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫H-⟪k:1⟫Hold on...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Your father was an artist here?!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫A-⟪k:1⟫Attendez...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Votre père a travaillé ici ?!"

#: scenario:scenario_5E34BE8D_9DC7_471B_ACDF_7167EECA3526
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 48259b504882f74dc76312f375b971623e31e77fd70a6b453fe03294ea53abbf
#. default-sha256: 7fd5888727e8ac400ee091347b455cec809a8029833bf5219d778373115e86f8
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_5E34BE8D_9DC7_471B_ACDF_7167EECA3526"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫...Yes.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫It was before I was born, so you probably don’t remember, Lord Mell."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫...Oui.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫C’était avant ma naissance, donc vous ne vous en souvenez probablement pas, "
"sieur Mell."

#: scenario:scenario_851E3FB0_CC76_4223_804B_301982622E88
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d881229588da3a110063cc0a22469e088bdd16537157c3c7b884d45efb6d6fed
#. default-sha256: 9ab1e70726e2d1cb575bc1c02af430dbf15588a78b7fcbba7637876677fade17
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_851E3FB0_CC76_4223_804B_301982622E88"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫So... ⟪k:1⟫you knew about us before you came here?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Si je comprends bien... ⟪k:1⟫vous nous connaissiez avant de venir ici ?"

#: scenario:scenario_534196E7_734B_42EC_BDEC_4BFF2AEE455D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 73b685d94cea11c4109b8c75ad8d6692e8d7795545f19a6533d662d7990a4cb6
#. default-sha256: 5bc388e0632ca3537b0902d6de7616668d4efd1b5998af95a2924411c657f417
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_534196E7_734B_42EC_BDEC_4BFF2AEE455D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫For as long as I can remember, I’ve known the name Rhodes."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Aussi longtemps que je m’en souvienne, j’ai toujours su qui étaient les Rhodes."

#: scenario:scenario_E3084A5A_0576_4250_AB4B_EE582C1FA553
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 49940f47325d5b09202ad88a23126ec134ff0c531f7c4c14646e6596cef91d51
