msgstr "⟪k:0⟫...!"

#: scenario:scenario_5E3FFC92_40C2_4D6A_B331_110CB044A00F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3f0c2cc38a819e8a15dbde99a4710de7112afc8ad46f93817a571d747856e56c
