#: scenario:scenario_4C79A825_BC8B_4501_A0B5_2BA0E88A8755
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 51319663e81cee2ec0e2e3e50e5e1f95fed4b3ebd03b5d763d961a50bad1f782
