msgctxt "scenario:scenario_4C79A825_BC8B_4501_A0B5_2BA0E88A8755"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The rose you tried to give me is an example of that.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫It was certainly crafted with "
"skill, but the jeweler is only known because some aristocrat spoke highly of him."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La rose que vous avez essayé de me donner en est un bel exemple.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Elle a "
"certainement été réalisée avec talent, mais le bijoutier n’est reconnu que parce qu’un "
"aristocrate a vanté ses mérites."

#: scenario:scenario_6962A1BA_5A83_4624_A0CC_8C6E364D191B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f5ac46978b02b8ce910b389bafd09b64b5ab79e83d435e59f71bf0bb2b65acab
#. default-sha256: 2ebf4a9eb7fb02b3fc2d45c6de7b38717ddd624d79d4b13c7136f10f3750e2f3
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_6962A1BA_5A83_4624_A0CC_8C6E364D191B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫My father’s paintings were no less skillful!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫His was a talent that could not be "
"easily imitated!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Quand il peignait, mon père était tout aussi talentueux !⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Son art ne pouvait pas "
"être aisément imité !"

#: scenario:scenario_915E5451_8083_472C_8693_C47ACEFE7ED5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 790d796bb578f36837afe7e4118b71eca80c4a058a0ff8e9656f27b530ad110e
#. default-sha256: 88a92eef184b0af9b03da56279d75d714db08d3ade94397079c3da50b09dfcdf
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_915E5451_8083_472C_8693_C47ACEFE7ED5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But no one was willing to separate the art from the artist."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Mais personne ne voulait différencier l’art de l’artiste."

#: scenario:scenario_21810620_3685_4F78_9BCA_832550E29B62
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 29b7a21b07c74a061ad7292fca4e9f72eb3a82d036053e3222a4d2d0b0000ebc
