msgctxt "scenario:scenario_21810620_3685_4F78_9BCA_832550E29B62"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The Rhodes family stole everything from my father.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫But even thrown out onto the "
"streets, his only skill was painting."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Les Rhodes lui ont tout pris.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Cependant, même une fois à la rue, son seul talent "
"restait la peinture."

#: scenario:scenario_571CF3A2_CEFA_4E6C_B91D_1E24807F6603
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f02c0077780f931cb2cefeaf1ae422a89113d47c9806328d8bbd607959262e94
