msgctxt "scenario:scenario_31E38DAE_533E_41D5_88DF_D96EA452F213"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫What little money we had for food, he gave to me.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫He did anything he could to "
"ensure my survival,⟪k:3⟫even at the expense of his own well-being."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Le peu d’argent qu’il avait pour manger, il me le donnait.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Il faisait tout ce qu’il "
"pouvait pour assurer ma survie,⟪k:3⟫même à ses dépens."

#: scenario:scenario_E3A8A197_803D_4EBC_8E0F_BD2FC6D493AC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fc7e80e710f78619f0ac9d5458aacde02ff8986c05efb1855efdfa278b7f744a
