msgid "⟪k:0⟫...My father passed away in this town."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫...Mon père mourut dans cette ville."

#: scenario:scenario_A06ABDFD_7866_46D3_9E53_D3FFA5ABA2EC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9176c13f5b43b906940ead5b2152f1434decf700bab0a46f24c07faa3122d4ee
