msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I imagined you were still living in decadence,⟪k:1⟫acting as though nothing had ever "
"happened."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Je m’imaginais que vous continuiez à vivre dans l’opulence,⟪k:1⟫à agir comme si de rien "
"n’était."

#: scenario:scenario_2E8B6A2C_E63A_40F1_AC64_11E4AF5DCA1C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
