msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫No, ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫you wouldn’t even care about the fate of one simple painter.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Our "
"lives meant nothing to you..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Oui, ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫vous vous moqueriez bien du destin d’un simple peintre.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Nos vies ne "
"valaient rien à vos yeux..."

#: scenario:scenario_069495CE_C027_4774_A7EF_20A347FC2145
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
