msgctxt "scenario:scenario_04CC19FC_1A0E_44AF_A957_81057F23BFFE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Not only because I am not aristocratic...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫but because every time I spoke with you,"
"⟪k:3⟫I did so holding this darkness in my heart."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Non seulement parce que je ne suis pas noble...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫mais parce que chaque fois que je "
"vous ai parlé,⟪k:3⟫je l’ai fait en dissimulant mon âme monstrueuse."

#: scenario:scenario_859A4039_694D_43E3_AF1C_2C7F4A4868F2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 63055b7d86cf649cbac1c46189f21471341688e679daea23718029a1898ac92b
