#: scenario:scenario_32336053_825C_4A4F_A92A_2BD11DC0E24B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 795e72f9989f3b4db31c2799cbdbb43930786a121189de6984f3f7c32ba08622
