msgctxt "scenario:scenario_32336053_825C_4A4F_A92A_2BD11DC0E24B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I assumed the residents of Rose Manor would be cold,⟪k:1⟫people who believed that wealth and "
"rank mattered above all."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Je pensais que les habitants du manoir des Roses seraient froids,⟪k:1⟫des gens qui croyaient "
"que l’argent et le pouvoir comptaient plus que tout."

#: scenario:scenario_96ADFF43_9B89_4340_804B_D4BE556E5EBB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e7a7b967f9e1ba57ea95291ceac0fce874fb1a0c0f35dbd02de04f9ebb2ce5dd
#. default-sha256: b027ee0fca2a6eab2c3b7451e22a6329d8e0b7e51e195fa6ba7a9c8cde76f745
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_96ADFF43_9B89_4340_804B_D4BE556E5EBB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But on the night of the storm,⟪k:1⟫the mistress was the first one to extend her hand to me."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Mais le soir de l’orage,⟪k:1⟫la maîtresse a été la première à me tendre la main."

#: scenario:scenario_7B76CFE3_409A_4B9A_814F_084FD1A08324
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e2a50ea4250654acdb77f664a1ed8bbd447a1df8103d02b95ee11cca3cd10bc9
#. default-sha256: 6fad25b1326174c45e5e7bdb9d2a0c2c548a3adf61ab94e3f83618a73dbd8e6e
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_7B76CFE3_409A_4B9A_814F_084FD1A08324"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I arrived at the mansion disguised as a beggar—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Actually, “disguised” is not the "
"right word, as many nights I only survived on the generosity of others."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Je suis arrivée au manoir déguisée en mendiante—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Enfin, « déguisée » n’est pas le "
"bon mot, vu que bien des nuits je n’ai dû ma survie qu’à la générosité des autres."

#: scenario:scenario_65863436_D2F5_43EB_8207_B6C7C3C0924A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fa84c216863af2c0179a0fdbecdb1ce69ccacaf7f6d30775b70e8158db2d04be
#. default-sha256: e6069a66554dc26ddbe6ef612287808cfe68a1394e4b20eaa1446e7ef168bcab
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_65863436_D2F5_43EB_8207_B6C7C3C0924A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The mistress did not send me away when she saw me.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Quite the opposite—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫she "
"took me in as a servant."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La maîtresse ne m’a pas renvoyée quand elle m’a vue.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Bien au contraire—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫"
"elle m’a prise comme servante."

#: scenario:scenario_8B3C936B_1D1B_4E2F_AD9A_79A6C8A2D79E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a3b5e68ff969bc74bdbd60bbade65df13ab0f9cdffa466744518f6c2d78d9a68
#. default-sha256: 0aca3c31fe043e627a1b41c76c04cb5f7ae3e1c2fa13efb94d1e2b3b41274eb7
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_8B3C936B_1D1B_4E2F_AD9A_79A6C8A2D79E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫So that was Mother’s doing."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫C’est donc grâce à Mère."

#: scenario:scenario_EA4815B8_4D8D_4CD4_93DE_13CDC1833F85
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7914faa6088259ff7833394c23cc039d67e951d8b4c4ee9298aa7bedde323f2b
#. default-sha256: 0b4d235ba31cad1b90c2a316ffab71d096f701d2d52fad849ad7e27da3ecb8cd
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_EA4815B8_4D8D_4CD4_93DE_13CDC1833F85"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I could scarcely believe she would invite a stranger into her home—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫that she "
"would treat a stranger with such compassion.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫I thought perhaps she knew who my father "
"was."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫J’avais du mal à croire qu’elle invite une étrangère dans sa maison—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫et "
"qu’elle traite cette étrangère avec tant de compassion.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Je m’étais dit qu’elle "
"connaîtrait peut-être mon père."

#: scenario:scenario_D56BD33A_0F0F_4EDB_A6D1_3CF0F78C5517
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bbd1ff9d19a85db4eef869aea9ced20698a2a8c8b6feaa1699e0d8e3229a14c4
#. default-sha256: 33f61e3690e64d8fa18491dadc6f297b4bbcd5c1a39e9d8a2cba3d22fc1c7165
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_D56BD33A_0F0F_4EDB_A6D1_3CF0F78C5517"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But I had never met any of you before,⟪k:1⟫so she must simply be that kindhearted a woman."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mais comme je ne vous ai jamais vus auparavant,⟪k:1⟫alors j’imagine qu’elle doit simplement "
"être une femme très généreuse."

#: scenario:scenario_7A982247_1E84_4602_B391_86DD1D3DB012
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3850594672df123c9144b896148478e196326301afdb458395118af1642f0be7
#. default-sha256: 8addf4eafd268782d754069de0a6d589ae59a5dfe97a57cd420b12622df547f9
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_7A982247_1E84_4602_B391_86DD1D3DB012"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And the mistress continued to treat me with kindness,⟪k:1⟫despite my disquieting appearance "
"and the darkness in my heart."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Et la maîtresse a continué à me traiter avec bonté,⟪k:1⟫malgré mon physique troublant et la "
"bassesse de mon âme."

#: scenario:scenario_0EF9F3A5_6B3C_4BF1_8083_D0739100F596
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dbbaca36c2586b979cab57bf8e9e29264c6d7b7c9a7254b6bd0235fd7315d97a
#. default-sha256: 46dae6d063ea6836e6d8f56c72cca247cd5bf1883df352660f2d3ca0e92d6d96
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_0EF9F3A5_6B3C_4BF1_8083_D0739100F596"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫In time, I began to grow less and less sure of myself.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Was what I meant to do truly "
"right?⟪k:3⟫Were the things I felt truly justified?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Avec le temps, j’ai commencé à être de moins en moins sûre de moi.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Mon plan était-"
"il vraiment juste ?⟪k:3⟫Ce que je ressentais, était-ce justifié ?"

#: scenario:scenario_8E7DA108_6859_4730_A4FF_05F1A6F1C2DD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f5d3c8d3491f8c65e6d31ff212d58f090caf242fe615ed1eb6dabbdadec602ea
#. default-sha256: 819df61e1f019b64a8f64b52bc0297845842f4824ad7ccc849ddede4c9f314b9
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_8E7DA108_6859_4730_A4FF_05F1A6F1C2DD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But it was a certain fact... ⟪k:1⟫that my father was here,⟪k:2⟫and that he had been chased "
"out."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mais une chose était certaine... ⟪k:1⟫mon père avait travaillé ici⟪k:2⟫et il en avait été "
"chassé."

#: scenario:scenario_49D6498C_B252_4187_8B74_E582162CB7C2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e68762666a68e60aab0f42b52681665111efa253bb7472b9fdd9531047602526
#. default-sha256: 864d751ca4bf111f6cbf54fbefc0f7e7bfa409e77fababaaf8200e287c201d97
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_49D6498C_B252_4187_8B74_E582162CB7C2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫So I decided I should take your life—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫to put an end to everything before I "
"wavered any further."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫C’est pourquoi je décidai de prendre votre vie—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫de mettre fin à tout cela "
"avant d’hésiter une fois encore."

