"⟪k:0⟫He wrapped his arms around her unbelievably slender, frail frame, holding her tight in an "
"affectionate embrace."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Il passa les bras autour de sa taille incroyablement fine et frêle et la serra fort contre "
"lui, affectueusement."

