msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Mell vint me voir le lendemain."

#: scenario:scenario_A41251B7_9250_4B65_9D8F_30BAC9398177
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5f0b74b326f4417e6f1abd05b521a0ac0ae8a28d13ba10c552ada77ae1ac3d39
