msgctxt "scenario:scenario_A41251B7_9250_4B65_9D8F_30BAC9398177"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He explained to me the course of events, and then asked me to dress her up more beautifully "
"than any other noble girl had ever been."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Il m’expliqua ce qu’il comptait faire puis me dit de lui trouver une robe et de l’habiller "
"de telle sorte qu’elle surpasse en beauté toutes les autres nobles."

#: scenario:scenario_B636FE98_E51B_4325_83D6_2944F597A7AE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 04f2d774a0c2ed86b40b1f9f8ca38e048cbb3d89ffac542e83a55e5bc9d58206
#. default-sha256: f8b31f02ae71835ddd5dc7d4a14320770005eb3159342ddb7431b34cfafd9601
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_B636FE98_E51B_4325_83D6_2944F597A7AE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She was already a very pretty girl, so even without much effort on my part—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫simply "
"putting her in a dress—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫she radiated beauty."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Comme elle était déjà très jolie, je n’eus pas à faire grand-chose —⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ simplement "
"lui mettre une robe —⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫ elle rayonnait de beauté."

#: scenario:scenario_8DC226C8_9DFB_42BA_BCF3_AEA74EE6CE67
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d8143a59fdfadd574a3d5d21c75a1beae177c8e3fc60b8f6bfd1cd9c938d1684
#. default-sha256: 8a0d77fb97f788f0936e288be333f91c271a159cdae252a4d3089736af1957fc
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_8DC226C8_9DFB_42BA_BCF3_AEA74EE6CE67"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I was quite partial to her smile, so I agreed to help, thinking that if it would lead to "
"their happiness, I could not ask for anything more."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫J’aimais beaucoup son sourire, alors j’acceptai de l’aider, en pensant que si cela menait à "
"son bonheur, que demander de plus ?"

#: scenario:scenario_D249464A_BE14_4518_91CF_059F78DC12D7
